    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/bcb64377f3bba6e187705ce95117ed54.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pera Coda</strong> is a narrative mystery adventure about a man trapped in a state between life and death. To escape, he must confront the memories, regrets, and relationships that shaped him. Set in a reimagined Istanbul, the game blends psychological drama, branching dialogue, and point-and-click puzzle solving in a haunting journey of guilt, healing, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2d4fdb08d14986c7d1897db2fe6a11b.poster.avif?t=1752831097\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2d4fdb08d14986c7d1897db2fe6a11b.webm?t=1752831097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2d4fdb08d14986c7d1897db2fe6a11b.mp4?t=1752831097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2ddafd7860e7b7c31d5632b62f879b1.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pera Coda is not just a mystery, it\u2019s an existential trial. You play a man trapped in a purgatory-like state, journeying back through his life: into his youth, his childhood, and the moments that shaped him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c5a8e9409b9f2c090575fc3d63b4f1aa.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich, psychological story through impactful dialogue choices and layered environmental puzzles. Puzzles are not just obstacles, they\u2019re emotional triggers that shape Deniz\u2019s understanding of himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c8c935632a21712ed376af6d30155a1d.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in a surreal reimagining of Istanbul, real locations, rich with local nuance and emotional texture that are rarely seen in games. Istanbul becomes both a stage and a mirror, where East meets West, chaos meets calm, and each district reflects a piece of a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/4c12684f125f0c588e9994b0a60edb61.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-drenched alleys to hauntingly familiar dreamscapes, Pera Coda blends retro-noir aesthetics with slight surrealism. Every environment is crafted to evoke emotion, with an isometric lens designed to highlight environmental clues, and visual storytelling. It\u2019s a city you don\u2019t just explore, you interpret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/38943c1225625b24b9d3305e8b2881a4.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with accessibility in mind, <i>Pera Coda</i> uses point-and-click, drag-based interactions to immerse players without overwhelming them. Complex emotional storytelling is delivered through simple, intuitive controls; no combat, no grind, just exploration, dialogue, and choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong><strong><i>Pera Coda</i></strong><strong> now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/4e0766d74cb7add5a92d28b02594c011.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/bcb64377f3bba6e187705ce95117ed54.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pera Coda</strong> is a narrative mystery adventure about a man trapped in a state between life and death. To escape, he must confront the memories, regrets, and relationships that shaped him. Set in a reimagined Istanbul, the game blends psychological drama, branching dialogue, and point-and-click puzzle solving in a haunting journey of guilt, healing, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2d4fdb08d14986c7d1897db2fe6a11b.poster.avif?t=1752831097\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2d4fdb08d14986c7d1897db2fe6a11b.webm?t=1752831097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2d4fdb08d14986c7d1897db2fe6a11b.mp4?t=1752831097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c2ddafd7860e7b7c31d5632b62f879b1.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pera Coda is not just a mystery, it\u2019s an existential trial. You play a man trapped in a purgatory-like state, journeying back through his life: into his youth, his childhood, and the moments that shaped him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c5a8e9409b9f2c090575fc3d63b4f1aa.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich, psychological story through impactful dialogue choices and layered environmental puzzles. Puzzles are not just obstacles, they\u2019re emotional triggers that shape Deniz\u2019s understanding of himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/c8c935632a21712ed376af6d30155a1d.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in a surreal reimagining of Istanbul, real locations, rich with local nuance and emotional texture that are rarely seen in games. Istanbul becomes both a stage and a mirror, where East meets West, chaos meets calm, and each district reflects a piece of a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/4c12684f125f0c588e9994b0a60edb61.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-drenched alleys to hauntingly familiar dreamscapes, Pera Coda blends retro-noir aesthetics with slight surrealism. Every environment is crafted to evoke emotion, with an isometric lens designed to highlight environmental clues, and visual storytelling. It\u2019s a city you don\u2019t just explore, you interpret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/38943c1225625b24b9d3305e8b2881a4.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with accessibility in mind, <i>Pera Coda</i> uses point-and-click, drag-based interactions to immerse players without overwhelming them. Complex emotional storytelling is delivered through simple, intuitive controls; no combat, no grind, just exploration, dialogue, and choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong><strong><i>Pera Coda</i></strong><strong> now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607300/extras/4e0766d74cb7add5a92d28b02594c011.avif?t=1752831097\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Pera Coda is a narrative mystery adventure about a man trapped between life and death. To escape, he must face his past, confront buried traumas, and stand trial for the life he lived. Set in Istanbul, it blends psychological drama, branching dialogue, and puzzles in a journey of self-discovery.",
